{"id":16919874978,"name":"Bear Alpha But 50 Players","desc":"Bear Alpha But 50 Players.\n---------------------------\nSprinting - Hold Shift on PC.\n---------------------------\nGame is in extremely early stage, anyone who wants to help or become a developer can tell in the game group.\n---------------------------\nOne day it began. Out of nowhere. Quite literally as if it was always here. Nobody knows where it came from, or where it went. Bear. Do you have what it takes to survive this monstrosity? Or maybe, just maybe, are you the monstrosity...?\n---------------------------\nInspired by: Cheedaman\n---------------------------\nBEAR* / Bear (Alpha)\nAre properties of Cheedaman.","path":"/game/16919874978-bear-alpha-but-50-players","slug":"16919874978-bear-alpha-but-50-players","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6f1064c4070bf8835b81f3a6be21e1156c44361176eb5831e17341c4a5c95286.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-50d53c632bef88b8b5cea2d67c434bab/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":50219,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-03-19T21:17:22.532Z","creator":{"name":"Hot Studio's","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"67db34628e21cc1fe76e136f","title":"Inventory and Shop Unlocker","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77fb8","gameId":16919874978,"name":"Bear Alpha But 50 Players","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"16919874978-bear-alpha-but-50-players","path":"/game/16919874978-bear-alpha-but-50-players","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":16919874978},"slug":"Bear-Alpha-But-50-Players-Inventory-and-Shop-Unlocker-32543","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":10736,"executes":83,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c857b32d46cfe86ede950c66e895f80e/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c857b32d46cfe86ede950c66e895f80e/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c857b32d46cfe86ede950c66e895f80e/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c857b32d46cfe86ede950c66e895f80e/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-03-19T21:17:22.532Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-19T21:17:22.532Z","lastBump":"2025-03-19T21:17:22.532Z","script":"--[[\n\tWARNING: Heads up! This script has not been verified by ScriptBlox. Use at your own risk!\n]]\nlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal playerGui = player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\nlocal shopGui = playerGui:WaitForChild(\"ShopGui\")\n\n-- Ensure ShopGui exists before proceeding\nif not shopGui then\n    warn(\"ShopGui not found in PlayerGui!\")\n    return\nend\n\n-- Get Inventory Skins Folder\nlocal inventory = shopGui:FindFirstChild(\"Inventory\")\nlocal inventorySkins = inventory and inventory:FindFirstChild(\"Skins\")\nlocal inventoryFolder = inventorySkins and inventorySkins:FindFirstChild(\"Folder\")\n\n-- Get Shop Skins Folder\nlocal shop = shopGui:FindFirstChild(\"Shop\")\nlocal shopSkins = shop and shop:FindFirstChild(\"Skins\")\nlocal shopFolder = shopSkins and shopSkins:FindFirstChild(\"Folder\")\n\n-- Function to make all ImageButtons visible inside a folder\nlocal function makeImageButtonsVisible(folder)\n    if folder then\n        for _, item in pairs(folder:GetChildren()) do\n            if item:IsA(\"ImageButton\") then\n                item.Visible = true\n            end\n        end\n    else\n        warn(\"Folder not found!\")\n    end\nend\n\n-- Make ImageButtons visible in both folders\nmakeImageButtonsVisible(inventoryFolder)\nmakeImageButtonsVisible(shopFolder)\n\n-- Change the \"Tokens\" IntValue inside the player to \"9999999\"\nlocal tokensValue = player:FindFirstChild(\"Tokens\")\nif tokensValue and tokensValue:IsA(\"IntValue\") then\n    tokensValue.Value = \"9999999\"\nelse\n    warn(\"Tokens IntValue not found in player!\")\nend\n","features":"In this script all you need to do is just execute it.\n--READ ME--\n\nThis is a script that unlocks most skins for you.\n\nYou may be able to get Ghostpepper...\n\n*Be in notice all of these are my scripts*","tags":["game","bear alpha","roblox","script","exploit","gamingroblox"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a","username":"ProScripts","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4d53cc07f1973cb69288c6f99ec272f6444e480286a3228c88b1f86df79f239.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a-1790904475090.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4d53cc07f1973cb69288c6f99ec272f6444e480286a3228c88b1f86df79f239.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a-1790904475090.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T03:11:00.104Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4dd5e","editBy":{"_id":"6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a","username":"ProScripts","status":"offline","id":"6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-19T21:29:10.159Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e7b360710ec3c55c42","editBy":{"_id":"6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a","username":"ProScripts","status":"offline","id":"6739a1a60a9caf676b450b1a"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:08:57.064Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"67db377664c81b298f6eea5b","commentBy":{"_id":"66f1d75b07679d43fc22f04b","userna